- title: Implement staged universal baseline
- difficulty_1_to_5: 3
- description: Implement a correctness-first three-stage Triton path: fused FP32 layer normalization plus spatial shuffle into contiguous BF16, FC1 with bias and exact-style GELU epilogue, then FC2 with bias.
- rationale: This decomposition preserves reuse of the shuffled input and FC1 activation, maps both dominant operations to tensor-core-friendly dense GEMMs, and establishes a measurable baseline before regime-specific tuning.

